OL,3,GNEWSA'Serious errors' found in trial of
OL,4,Awoman convicted of killing a baby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere were "serious errors" in the
OL,7,Fconduct of a high-profile trial in
OL,8,Fwhich a woman was convicted of
OL,9,Fmurdering her baby, the Court of Appeal
OL,10,Fhas found.
OL,12,FThe court found there was serious
OL,13,Fexpert witness and prosecutorial
OL,14,Fmisconduct, and poor handling of the
OL,15,F2023 trial by the judge.
OL,17,FThe woman's convictions, for the murder
OL,18,Fof her baby and attempted murder of her
OL,19,Ftoddler, were quashed by the court in
OL,20,F2025 and a retrial was ordered.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
